{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KXMvzSNGxjEGJNd4WZqUXe","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 01: First Runtime Producer Evidence\n2\t\n3\tStatus: active; H1.S3 packet prepared, pass-claim checkpoint pending\n4\tLast updated: 2026-05-07\n5\t\n6\t## Objective\n7\t\n8\tBuild the runtime-producer evidence substrate required before the true `VISION.md` minimum-useful CBM floor can be cleared.\n9\t\n10\tAcceptance criterion: recovery interventions are complete, runtime-producer/Skeptic evidence exists, and planning truthfully routes the next `/goal` to H1 in `.planning/HORIZONS.md`. The true minimum-useful-CBM pass claim remains open until H1.S1-H1.S3 are complete and cross-model reviewed.\n11\t\n12\t## Intervention Track\n13\t\n14\t- I-S1: Live Codex CLI isolation probe. Status: completed before this phase bundle was formalized; evidence at `.planning/spikes/2026-05-02-codex-isolation-live/RESULT.md`.\n15\t- I-S3 plus I-X3: loop-status review-completion and checkpoint gates. Status: completed in `1803acb`.\n16\t- I-S4a: Codex CLI timeout and run-id validation. Status: completed across `bd66d14` and `6c52a84`.\n17\t- I-S4b: Codex CLI output-path enforcement and stderr/stdout tee. Status: completed in `c165f79`.\n18\t- I-S5: ADR ledger seed. Status: completed in `8d0239f`.\n19\t- I-X2: per-phase artifact bundle convention. Status: completed in `dc6b43b`.\n20\t- I-X1: CBM-native cross-model checkpoint primitive. Status: completed in `f0efb2e`; actual pass-claim review packet remains out of scope.\n21\t- I-S2: skill loader and first real Skeptic artifact on MCP `src/git`. Status: completed early in `3748d72` and `0a2b6f0`; must be reconciled with I-X1 before any pass claim.\n22\t- I-S6: Codex CLI failure-mode regression set. Status: completed in `879afb7`.\n23\t- I-S7: honest-baseline banner on handoff/cards. Status: completed in `91f1f95`.\n24\t- H1.S1: real Surface Mapper producer on pinned MCP `src/git`. Status: completed; evidence at `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-02-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1/RESULT.md`.\n25\t- H1.S2a: H1.S1 evidence-bundle repair. Status: completed; H1.S1 handoff honesty, dev-fixture Skeptic handling, unknown-edge acceptance, repair evidence preservation, and packet caveats were remediated before real Skeptic review.\n26\t- H1.S2b: real isolated Skeptic review on pinned MCP `src/git`. Status: completed; evidence at `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2b-skeptic/RESULT.md`.\n27\t- H1.S2c: challenge ingestion and mapper response disposition. Status: completed; evidence at `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2c-disposition/RESULT.md`.\n28\t- H1.S3: validated minimum-useful handoff and non-current-model checkpoint packet. Status: prepared; packet at `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/`, checkpoint skeleton at `.planning/reviews/2026-05-07-h1-minimum-useful-checkpoint/`.\n29\t\n30\tPhase 01 remains open until the non-current-model checkpoint disposition accepts the H1 pass claim.\n31\t\n32\t## Verification\n33\t\n34\t- Per-slice focused regressions and cross-regressions as listed in `.planning/reviews/2026-05-02-opus-cross-vendor-audit/INTERVENTIONS.md`.\n35\t- Full `TMPDIR=/var/tmp pytest -q` after each intervention.\n36\t- Post-commit `python3 -m cbm.cli loop-status --repo . --scope recovery-slice --work-category <category> --json`.\n37\t- H1.S1 artifact validation, citation resolution, evidence check, and handoff validation as recorded in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-02-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1/RESULT.md`.\n38\t- H1.S2b Skeptic validation, citation resolution, run-manifest validation, handoff validation, and surface-map evidence validation as recorded in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2b-skeptic/RESULT.md`.\n39\t- H1.S2c surface-map validation, citation resolution, evidence check, handoff validation, and full suite as recorded in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2c-disposition/RESULT.md`.\n40\t- H1.S3 handoff packet validation is recorded in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/VERIFY.md`.\n41\t\n42\t## Stop Conditions\n43\t\n44\tFollow `.planning/reviews/2026-05-02-opus-cross-vendor-audit/INTERVENTIONS.md` and `AGENTS.md`.\n45\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6cbc7cf-fde2-43ca-881c-5166caea7a38","uuid":"d71b16db-9568-43b5-a477-1ecdaf62798a","timestamp":"2026-05-08T02:31:23.150Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/rookslog/Development/cbm/.planning/phases/01-first-runtime-producer-evidence/PLAN.md","content":"# Phase 01: First Runtime Producer Evidence\n\nStatus: active; H1.S3 packet prepared, pass-claim checkpoint pending\nLast updated: 2026-05-07\n\n## Objective\n\nBuild the runtime-producer evidence substrate required before the true `VISION.md` minimum-useful CBM floor can be cleared.\n\nAcceptance criterion: recovery interventions are complete, runtime-producer/Skeptic evidence exists, and planning truthfully routes the next `/goal` to H1 in `.planning/HORIZONS.md`. The true minimum-useful-CBM pass claim remains open until H1.S1-H1.S3 are complete and cross-model reviewed.\n\n## Intervention Track\n\n- I-S1: Live Codex CLI isolation probe. Status: completed before this phase bundle was formalized; evidence at `.planning/spikes/2026-05-02-codex-isolation-live/RESULT.md`.\n- I-S3 plus I-X3: loop-status review-completion and checkpoint gates. Status: completed in `1803acb`.\n- I-S4a: Codex CLI timeout and run-id validation. Status: completed across `bd66d14` and `6c52a84`.\n- I-S4b: Codex CLI output-path enforcement and stderr/stdout tee. Status: completed in `c165f79`.\n- I-S5: ADR ledger seed. Status: completed in `8d0239f`.\n- I-X2: per-phase artifact bundle convention. Status: completed in `dc6b43b`.\n- I-X1: CBM-native cross-model checkpoint primitive. Status: completed in `f0efb2e`; actual pass-claim review packet remains out of scope.\n- I-S2: skill loader and first real Skeptic artifact on MCP `src/git`. Status: completed early in `3748d72` and `0a2b6f0`; must be reconciled with I-X1 before any pass claim.\n- I-S6: Codex CLI failure-mode regression set. Status: completed in `879afb7`.\n- I-S7: honest-baseline banner on handoff/cards. Status: completed in `91f1f95`.\n- H1.S1: real Surface Mapper producer on pinned MCP `src/git`. Status: completed; evidence at `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-02-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1/RESULT.md`.\n- H1.S2a: H1.S1 evidence-bundle repair. Status: completed; H1.S1 handoff honesty, dev-fixture Skeptic handling, unknown-edge acceptance, repair evidence preservation, and packet caveats were remediated before real Skeptic review.\n- H1.S2b: real isolated Skeptic review on pinned MCP `src/git`. Status: completed; evidence at `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2b-skeptic/RESULT.md`.\n- H1.S2c: challenge ingestion and mapper response disposition. Status: completed; evidence at `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2c-disposition/RESULT.md`.\n- H1.S3: validated minimum-useful handoff and non-current-model checkpoint packet. Status: prepared; packet at `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/`, checkpoint skeleton at `.planning/reviews/2026-05-07-h1-minimum-useful-checkpoint/`.\n\nPhase 01 remains open until the non-current-model checkpoint disposition accepts the H1 pass claim.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Per-slice focused regressions and cross-regressions as listed in `.planning/reviews/2026-05-02-opus-cross-vendor-audit/INTERVENTIONS.md`.\n- Full `TMPDIR=/var/tmp pytest -q` after each intervention.\n- Post-commit `python3 -m cbm.cli loop-status --repo . --scope recovery-slice --work-category <category> --json`.\n- H1.S1 artifact validation, citation resolution, evidence check, and handoff validation as recorded in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-02-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1/RESULT.md`.\n- H1.S2b Skeptic validation, citation resolution, run-manifest validation, handoff validation, and surface-map evidence validation as recorded in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2b-skeptic/RESULT.md`.\n- H1.S2c surface-map validation, citation resolution, evidence check, handoff validation, and full suite as recorded in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2c-disposition/RESULT.md`.\n- H1.S3 handoff packet validation is recorded in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/VERIFY.md`.\n\n## Stop Conditions\n\nFollow `.planning/reviews/2026-05-02-opus-cross-vendor-audit/INTERVENTIONS.md` and `AGENTS.md`.\n","numLines":45,"startLine":1,"totalLines":45}}}
