{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BGXNKDKMSC49wypKZGHhc4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 01 Verification\n2\t\n3\tStatus: partial; intervention track closed, H1.S1-H1.S3 packet prepared, checkpoint pending\n4\tLast updated: 2026-05-07\n5\t\n6\t## Completed Intervention Evidence\n7\t\n8\t- I-S1 live Codex CLI isolation through `cbm run`: completed in `021a004`; artifact `.planning/spikes/2026-05-02-codex-isolation-live.md`; outcome `verified`.\n9\t- I-S3 plus I-X3 loop-status and cross-model checkpoint gates: completed in `1803acb`.\n10\t- I-S4a timeout, timeout cause, partial output, and run-id validation: completed in `6c52a84`.\n11\t- I-S4b output-path enforcement, stdout/stderr logs, and manifest hashes: completed in `c165f79`.\n12\t- I-S5 ADR ledger seed: completed in `8d0239f`.\n13\t- I-X2 per-phase artifact bundle convention: completed in `dc6b43b`.\n14\t- I-X1 native checkpoint packet command: completed in `f0efb2e`.\n15\t- I-S2 formal skill-loader compatibility surface: completed in `65c19f2`; runtime skill-loaded Skeptic evidence exists in `3748d72` and `0a2b6f0`.\n16\t- I-S6 Codex CLI failure-mode regression set: completed in `879afb7`.\n17\t- I-S7 honest baseline banner on handoffs/cards: completed in `91f1f95`.\n18\t\n19\t## Final Checks\n20\t\n21\t- `TMPDIR=/var/tmp pytest -q` reported `100 passed, 2 warnings`.\n22\t- `python3 -m cbm.cli loop-status --repo . --scope recovery-slice --work-category runtime-producer --json` reported `status: ok`, no issues, and no warnings.\n23\t- `python3 -m cbm.cli loop-status --repo . --scope broad-goal --work-category runtime-producer --json` reported `status: ok`, no issues, and no warnings.\n24\t- Historical check: `python3 -m cbm.cli loop-status --repo . --scope pass-claim --work-category runtime-producer --json` reported `status: fail` with `same_model_checkpoint`. This was expected before the H1.S3 packet existed.\n25\t\n26\t## Remaining Close Evidence\n27\t\n28\t- Real Surface Mapper artifact exists for H1.S1. Status: completed in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-02-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1/RESULT.md`.\n29\t- H1.S2a evidence-bundle repair is complete. Status: completed before real Skeptic review.\n30\t- Real isolated Skeptic review exists for H1.S2b. Status: completed in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2b-skeptic/RESULT.md`.\n31\t- H1.S2c challenge disposition is complete. Status: completed in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2c-disposition/RESULT.md`.\n32\t- Validated H1.S3 handoff packet exists. Status: prepared in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/`.\n33\t- H1 minimum-useful-CBM pass-claim checkpoint packet exists. Status: prepared in `.planning/reviews/2026-05-07-h1-minimum-useful-checkpoint/`.\n34\t- A non-current-model reviewer dispositions the pass claim as `accept`. Status: pending.\n35\t- `cbm-loop-status --scope pass-claim` exits 0. Status: pending; expected to fail while reviewer identity and disposition are blank.\n36\t- At least one additional small external runtime-producer target validates if the next phase chooses repeatability before broader roadmap work.\n37\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6cbc7cf-fde2-43ca-881c-5166caea7a38","uuid":"f473069d-3aa0-4d91-8397-0849430be936","timestamp":"2026-05-08T02:31:24.305Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/rookslog/Development/cbm/.planning/phases/01-first-runtime-producer-evidence/VERIFICATION.md","content":"# Phase 01 Verification\n\nStatus: partial; intervention track closed, H1.S1-H1.S3 packet prepared, checkpoint pending\nLast updated: 2026-05-07\n\n## Completed Intervention Evidence\n\n- I-S1 live Codex CLI isolation through `cbm run`: completed in `021a004`; artifact `.planning/spikes/2026-05-02-codex-isolation-live.md`; outcome `verified`.\n- I-S3 plus I-X3 loop-status and cross-model checkpoint gates: completed in `1803acb`.\n- I-S4a timeout, timeout cause, partial output, and run-id validation: completed in `6c52a84`.\n- I-S4b output-path enforcement, stdout/stderr logs, and manifest hashes: completed in `c165f79`.\n- I-S5 ADR ledger seed: completed in `8d0239f`.\n- I-X2 per-phase artifact bundle convention: completed in `dc6b43b`.\n- I-X1 native checkpoint packet command: completed in `f0efb2e`.\n- I-S2 formal skill-loader compatibility surface: completed in `65c19f2`; runtime skill-loaded Skeptic evidence exists in `3748d72` and `0a2b6f0`.\n- I-S6 Codex CLI failure-mode regression set: completed in `879afb7`.\n- I-S7 honest baseline banner on handoffs/cards: completed in `91f1f95`.\n\n## Final Checks\n\n- `TMPDIR=/var/tmp pytest -q` reported `100 passed, 2 warnings`.\n- `python3 -m cbm.cli loop-status --repo . --scope recovery-slice --work-category runtime-producer --json` reported `status: ok`, no issues, and no warnings.\n- `python3 -m cbm.cli loop-status --repo . --scope broad-goal --work-category runtime-producer --json` reported `status: ok`, no issues, and no warnings.\n- Historical check: `python3 -m cbm.cli loop-status --repo . --scope pass-claim --work-category runtime-producer --json` reported `status: fail` with `same_model_checkpoint`. This was expected before the H1.S3 packet existed.\n\n## Remaining Close Evidence\n\n- Real Surface Mapper artifact exists for H1.S1. Status: completed in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-02-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1/RESULT.md`.\n- H1.S2a evidence-bundle repair is complete. Status: completed before real Skeptic review.\n- Real isolated Skeptic review exists for H1.S2b. Status: completed in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2b-skeptic/RESULT.md`.\n- H1.S2c challenge disposition is complete. Status: completed in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s2c-disposition/RESULT.md`.\n- Validated H1.S3 handoff packet exists. Status: prepared in `.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/`.\n- H1 minimum-useful-CBM pass-claim checkpoint packet exists. Status: prepared in `.planning/reviews/2026-05-07-h1-minimum-useful-checkpoint/`.\n- A non-current-model reviewer dispositions the pass claim as `accept`. Status: pending.\n- `cbm-loop-status --scope pass-claim` exits 0. Status: pending; expected to fail while reviewer identity and disposition are blank.\n- At least one additional small external runtime-producer target validates if the next phase chooses repeatability before broader roadmap work.\n","numLines":37,"startLine":1,"totalLines":37}}}
