{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018tBLwsT8jMF9FVKycWzZAE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# H1.S1 MCP Git Surface Mapper Benchmark\n2\t\n3\tStatus: passed\n4\t\n5\t## Target\n6\t\n7\t- Repository: `https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers`\n8\t- Subtree: `src/git`\n9\t- Pinned SHA: `4503e2d12b799448cd05f789dd40f9643a8d1a6c`\n10\t- Local checkout used: `/var/tmp/cbm-h1-mcp-servers-4503e2d/src/git`\n11\t- Run id: `run-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1-6`\n12\t\n13\t## Command\n14\t\n15\t```bash\n16\tTMPDIR=/var/tmp python3 -m cbm.cli run \\\n17\t  --repo /var/tmp/cbm-h1-mcp-servers-4503e2d/src/git \\\n18\t  --goal \"produce real Surface Mapper map for MCP git server surfaces\" \\\n19\t  --backend codex-cli \\\n20\t  --allow-live-codex \\\n21\t  --codex-surface-mode skill \\\n22\t  --codex-skeptic-mode none \\\n23\t  --codex-model gpt-5.4-mini \\\n24\t  --codex-reasoning-effort medium \\\n25\t  --mode lightweight \\\n26\t  --run-id run-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1-6 \\\n27\t  --codex-timeout 600\n28\t```\n29\t\n30\t## Evidence\n31\t\n32\t- `surface-map.json` validates and is produced by `surface-mapper@1.2`.\n33\t- `run-manifest.json` records `codex-cli-skill-surface-map` with backend `codex-cli`, producer `surface-mapper@1.2`, and runtime skill `surface-mapping`.\n34\t- `producer-registry.json` records `surface_map` as `surface-mapper@1.2` on backend `codex-cli`.\n35\t- `handoff.md` was repaired during H1.S2a to describe the promoted runtime Surface Mapper output honestly, derive coverage from `surface-map.json`, and avoid counting the dev-fixture Skeptic fallback as real review.\n36\t- `verify-citations surface-map.json` resolved 25 source citations at `4503e2d12b79`.\n37\t- `check-evidence surface-map.json` passed.\n38\t\n39\t## Surface Summary\n40\t\n41\t- Coverage: 12 files in scope, 7 directly examined, 12 inspected via extractor, 0 unread.\n42\t- Claim registers: factual, inferential, interpretive.\n43\t- Artifact size