{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012i4DuK4LNyBNN3wYmATyyn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Included Artifacts\n2\t\n3\tStatus: prepared\n4\tDate: 2026-05-07\n5\t\n6\t## Packet Root\n7\t\n8\t```text\n9\t.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/\n10\t  RESULT.md\n11\t  HANDOFF.md\n12\t  VERIFY.md\n13\t  LINEAGE.md\n14\t  CHECKPOINT-PACKET.md\n15\t  CHECKPOINT-PROMPT.md\n16\t  INCLUDED-ARTIFACTS.md\n17\t  surface-map.json\n18\t  skeptic-review-surface-map.md\n19\t  source-h1s2c-handoff.md\n20\t  evidence-ledger.jsonl\n21\t  .research/run-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1-6/\n22\t  .research/run-mcp-git-h1s2b-skeptic-1/\n23\t  .research/run-mcp-git-h1s2c-disposition-1/\n24\t```\n25\t\n26\t## Preservation Strategy\n27\t\n28\tNo new runtime producer command naturally creates an H1.S3 `.research/<run_id>` tree because H1.S3 is handoff/checkpoint preparation over already-produced H1.S1 and H1.S2 artifacts.\n29\t\n30\tThe packet therefore preserves:\n31\t\n32\t- the exact final H1.S2c surface map promoted for checkpoint review;\n33\t- the exact H1.S2b rendered Skeptic review promoted for checkpoint review;\n34\t- the exact H1.S2c handoff and evidence ledger;\n35\t- the available full source run trees for H1.S1, H1.S2b, and H1.S2c.\n36\t\n37\t`codex_outputs/` and `logs/` directories inside the preserved run trees are source-stage audit evidence. In particular, the H1.S2b tree contains the real isolated Skeptic model output and logs; the H1.S2c tree may carry copied/imported Skeptic output evidence from H1.S2b. H1.S3 did not launch a new live runtime producer.\n38\t\n39\tThe H1.S1 run tree was available locally at `/var/tmp/cbm-h1-mcp-servers-4503e2d/src/git/.research/run-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1-6/` and is now preserved in this H1.S3 packet. This improves retrospective auditability compared with the original H1.S1 convenience benchmark packet, whose `RESULT.md` recorded that the full run tree had not been copied at publication time.\n40\t\n41\t## Review Packet\n42\t\n43\tNon-current-model checkpoint review files are prepared at:\n44\t\n45\t```text\n46\t.planning/reviews/2026-05-07-h1-minimum-useful-checkpoint/\n47\t  PROMPT.md\n48\t  CHECKPOINT.md\n49\t  DISPOSITION.md\n50\t  EVIDENCE-MANIFEST.md\n51\t```\n52\t\n53\tThe benchmark packet mirrors the checkpoint prompt and packet index for reviewer convenience:\n54\t\n55\t```text\n56\tCHECKPOINT-PROMPT.md\n57\tCHECKPOINT-PACKET.md\n58\t```\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6cbc7cf-fde2-43ca-881c-5166caea7a38","uuid":"3f4d3f1e-3d5e-409f-a173-a4efd923e63a","timestamp":"2026-05-08T02:31:38.999Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/rookslog/Development/cbm/.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/INCLUDED-ARTIFACTS.md","content":"# Included Artifacts\n\nStatus: prepared\nDate: 2026-05-07\n\n## Packet Root\n\n```text\n.planning/benchmarks/2026-05-07-mcp-git-h1s3-minimum-useful-handoff/\n  RESULT.md\n  HANDOFF.md\n  VERIFY.md\n  LINEAGE.md\n  CHECKPOINT-PACKET.md\n  CHECKPOINT-PROMPT.md\n  INCLUDED-ARTIFACTS.md\n  surface-map.json\n  skeptic-review-surface-map.md\n  source-h1s2c-handoff.md\n  evidence-ledger.jsonl\n  .research/run-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1-6/\n  .research/run-mcp-git-h1s2b-skeptic-1/\n  .research/run-mcp-git-h1s2c-disposition-1/\n```\n\n## Preservation Strategy\n\nNo new runtime producer command naturally creates an H1.S3 `.research/<run_id>` tree because H1.S3 is handoff/checkpoint preparation over already-produced H1.S1 and H1.S2 artifacts.\n\nThe packet therefore preserves:\n\n- the exact final H1.S2c surface map promoted for checkpoint review;\n- the exact H1.S2b rendered Skeptic review promoted for checkpoint review;\n- the exact H1.S2c handoff and evidence ledger;\n- the available full source run trees for H1.S1, H1.S2b, and H1.S2c.\n\n`codex_outputs/` and `logs/` directories inside the preserved run trees are source-stage audit evidence. In particular, the H1.S2b tree contains the real isolated Skeptic model output and logs; the H1.S2c tree may carry copied/imported Skeptic output evidence from H1.S2b. H1.S3 did not launch a new live runtime producer.\n\nThe H1.S1 run tree was available locally at `/var/tmp/cbm-h1-mcp-servers-4503e2d/src/git/.research/run-mcp-git-surface-mapper-h1s1-6/` and is now preserved in this H1.S3 packet. This improves retrospective auditability compared with the original H1.S1 convenience benchmark packet, whose `RESULT.md` recorded that the full run tree had not been copied at publication time.\n\n## Review Packet\n\nNon-current-model checkpoint review files are prepared at:\n\n```text\n.planning/reviews/2026-05-07-h1-minimum-useful-checkpoint/\n  PROMPT.md\n  CHECKPOINT.md\n  DISPOSITION.md\n  EVIDENCE-MANIFEST.md\n```\n\nThe benchmark packet mirrors the checkpoint prompt and packet index for reviewer convenience:\n\n```text\nCHECKPOINT-PROMPT.md\nCHECKPOINT-PACKET.md\n```\n","numLines":59,"startLine":1,"totalLines":59}}}
